<title>JAPAN: Tohcello - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tohcello - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.03		vs	   21.64</p>
<p> Operating	  839 million	 vs	  708 million</p>
<p> Current	    757 million	 vs	  705 million</p>
<p> Net		  372 million	 vs	  171 million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.27 yen	  vs	    5.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tohcello Co Ltd is a leading maker of polypropylene wrapping film.</p>
